{"4363600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rapplar", "steam_appid": 4363600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># ABOUT THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey through a mystical world where three ancient races vie for dominance. **Rapplar** is a rich action RPG that blends deep character customization, tactical combat, and immersive storytelling in a beautifully crafted fantasy realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## CHOOSE YOUR DESTINY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from **three unique races**, each with their own rich heritage and abilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Asura** – Fierce warriors born from ancient bloodlines, masters of physical combat and primal strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Deva** – Divine beings blessed with celestial powers, wielding magic and wisdom from the heavens  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Gaia** – Children of nature, attuned to the earth's energies and the balance of all living things</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Male and Female** options available for each race, allowing you to truly create your own hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## MASTER YOUR CLASS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path between two powerful classes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Warrior** – Unleash devastating melee attacks, master weapons, and become an unstoppable force on the battlefield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Mage** – Harness arcane energies, cast powerful spells, and control the elements to dominate your enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## EXPLORE A LIVING WORLD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse regions, each with its own atmosphere, music, and secrets:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Islands Realm** – Peaceful grasslands filled with ambient sounds and melodic tunes from distant lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Dynamic Regions** – Experience unique environmental effect